that I've been investing

00:09:56.930 --> 00:10:01.930
myself in for months, over
six months of investment

00:10:06.390 --> 00:10:09.513
has led up to this
morning and what happened.

00:10:09.513 --> 00:10:10.346
Okay.

00:10:10.346 --> 00:10:12.380
And, I'm extremely proud of myself.

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:13.553
I finally achieved it.

00:10:16.290 --> 00:10:20.680
My daughter drove herself and her brother

00:10:20.680 --> 00:10:25.680
to school themselves, herself.

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:29.870
That's right, my daughter,
Lilly, 16 years old,

00:10:29.870 --> 00:10:31.680
has a bonafide driver's license.

00:10:31.680 --> 00:10:33.110
She got in a car.

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:35.790
Her brother, Lincoln,
got in the passenger seat

00:10:35.790 --> 00:10:39.960
and they drove to school
and I didn't take 'em,

00:10:39.960 --> 00:10:42.400
Christy didn't take 'em and no one had

00:10:42.400 --> 00:10:46.070
to come back with the
car because she drove it.

00:10:46.070 --> 00:10:47.200
She parked it.

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:49.830
She got out of it and
she walked into school.

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:51.353
I'm so proud of myself.

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:54.680
It took a lotta work.

00:10:54.680 --> 00:10:55.730
This was not easy.

00:10:55.730 --> 00:10:58.480
Now, I know that you had
resistance initially,

00:10:58.480 --> 00:11:00.480
in this, the same resistance
that I am currently

00:11:00.480 --> 00:11:01.670
experiencing, which is.

00:11:01.670 --> 00:11:02.880
Way to go, me.

00:11:02.880 --> 00:11:04.910
It's a different time, right?

00:11:04.910 --> 00:11:08.440
And LA is also different
than where we grew up,

00:11:08.440 --> 00:11:10.270
but it has been difficult to get our kids.

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:14.100
I cannot get Lock, who
will be 16 in February,

00:11:14.100 --> 00:11:16.510
I cannot get him to begin Driver's Ed.

00:11:16.510 --> 00:11:18.030
Oh, gosh.

00:11:18.030 --> 00:11:22.340
Yeah, and he could've,
I think at 14 and a half

00:11:22.340 --> 00:11:24.033
you can start takin' the class.

00:11:24.890 --> 00:11:27.790
So, by 15 you're eligible
to get your learner's permit

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:29.523
and you have to have it
a certain amount of time.

00:11:29.523 --> 00:11:31.416
And I'm the only person in my family

00:11:31.416 --> 00:11:33.560
who is an advocate for this.

00:11:33.560 --> 00:11:36.630
For some reason Lock doesn't
care 'cause he takes Uber.

00:11:36.630 --> 00:11:39.740
Lilly was not motivated,
but I was very motivated.

00:11:39.740 --> 00:11:41.481
I mean, I got two more kids in the house.

00:11:41.481 --> 00:11:45.637
And, I'm not the one doin'
most of the runnin' around.

00:11:45.637 --> 00:11:50.637
Christy would be like, I
feel like I'm a taxi driver.

00:11:50.774 --> 00:11:52.960
She would make that
complaint and I would get it.

00:11:52.960 --> 00:11:55.340
'Cause I mean, even on
the weekends or when I

00:11:55.340 --> 00:11:56.721
